WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
Cross certain tall pea
plants with each other.

2
00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.260
Most of the offspring grow tall.

3
00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:09.200
But some come up short, though
neither parent is short.

4
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.230
Mendel saw the same pattern.

5
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:17.360
For stem length, his counts
were 787 long and 277 short.

6
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.970
So where was the short plant hiding?

7
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.960
In this mission, you'll
meet genes and alleles,

8
00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:26.720
and the words for what an organism
carries and what it shows.

9
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.620
Then you'll look at Mendel's
counts for 7 traits,

10
00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:33.570
and see why none lands
exactly on its expected ratio.

11
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:36.990
Your mission: find out where
the short plant was hiding.
